  <text id="subtitle" x="86" y="108" width="1040" height="52" font="body" size="20" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>In Nigeria, permits are not abstract files. They are decisions tied to land, corridors, sites, communities, facilities, and field events.</p></text>

